  "install_text": "**Senstick SPU30**\n\nLoRaWAN indoor air quality sensor measuring temperature, humidity, air pressure, CO2, and TVOC.\n\n**Key features:**\n\n- LoRaWAN end-to-end encryption and data integrity protection\n- Monitors carbon dioxide, volatile organic compounds, temperature, relative humidity, and air pressure\n- Long battery life\n- Sending interval configurable via downlink\n- Li-Ion battery for long-term autonomous operation",
